Keep a shared grid as empty text.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared visited as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared limit as 0.
To wipe from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 15, return.
Set item spot of visited to 0.
Wipe from spot plus 1.

To search from row (a whole number) at column (a whole number) with index (a whole number).
If found is 1, return.
If row is less than 0 or row is more than 3 or column is less than 0 or column is more than 3, return.
The node is row times 4 plus column.
If item node of visited is 1, return.
If character node of grid is not character index of current, return.
If index is limit, set found to 1, return.
Set item node of visited to 1.
If found is 0, search from row plus 1 at column with index plus 1.
If found is 0, search from row minus 1 at column with index plus 1.
If found is 0, search from row at column plus 1 with index plus 1.
If found is 0, search from row at column minus 1 with index plus 1.
Set item node of visited to 0.

To seek from node (a whole number).
If node is more than 15, return.
If found is 1, return.
The row is node divided by 4.
The column is node modulo 4.
Search from row at column with 0.
Seek from node plus 1.

The board is "oaanetaeihkriflv".
The gridcopy is a copy of board.
Set grid to gridcopy.
The words is "oath,pea,eat,rain".
The items is split words by ",".
The answers is an empty list of text.
For every spot from 0 to 15.
Place 0 into visited.

For each word in items.
