Set current to copy.
The final is the last position of current.
Set limit to final.
Set found to 0.
Wipe from 0.
Seek from 0.
If found is 1, Place copy into answers.

The total is the number of items in answers.
The last is total minus 1.
For every left from 0 to last.
For every right from left to last.
If item right of answers comes before item left of answers, swap item left of answers and item right of answers.

For each answer in answers, show answer.
